        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "warnings": [
    {
      "text": {
        "fa": "هشدار جعبه‌ای: افزایش خطر افکار و رفتار خودکشی در کودکان و جوانان؛ پایش دقیق.",
        "en": "Boxed warning: increased risk of suicidal thoughts and behaviors in pediatric and young adult patients; monitor closely."
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-sertraline",
          "section": "WARNING: SUICIDAL THOUGHTS AND BEHAVIORS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "fa": "پیش از شروع، سابقه شخصی/خانوادگی دوقطبی یا مانیا بررسی شود.",
        "en": "Screen for personal/family history of bipolar disorder or mania before starting."
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-sertraline",
          "section": "2.3"
        }
      ]
    }
